{"3332460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Slime Garden", "steam_appid": 3332460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/bbaa67942f32bf2d65b1e67c6c5afa72.avif?t=1788162591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras_big/bbaa67942f32bf2d65b1e67c6c5afa72.webp?t=1788162591 width=1560 height=987 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/cbabd6b521fab7967f776463c90a2c95.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow, nurture, and unleash a team of lovable slimes with endless possibilities! In this enchanting survival journey, breed quirky slime combinations, face wild island challenges, and embrace the thrill of adventure with your gooey companions. Can you raise the perfect slime squad to brave the unpredictable elements and explore as far as the islands go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/8537bdfa952e0a6dd9aa8c9f1cd362b2.avif?t=1788162591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras_big/8537bdfa952e0a6dd9aa8c9f1cd362b2.webp?t=1788162591 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/a5f089329e9130dbb713dbf9cea70207.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Monthly Updates + Nightly Beta Builds!</strong> <br>Weekly updates with new accessories and items to  increase the size of your collection and more! (Join the nightly beta option for semi-daily updates for new contents that will later be included in the weekly public builds!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/2872e8d0e1df2cae260383fcc08e931e.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover endless possibilities as you breed different slimes, combining traits from both parents to create new, one-of-a-kind slime companions with unique abilities and appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/3588ed62e5d4552d46cbe4199560d186.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1316 height=1068 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/7f1dc0568eb7146809560ec8444dc5ee.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strengthen your slimes by feeding them, raising their stats, and unlocking new abilities. Proper care is essential for building a powerful team that can endure the challenges of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/5d701fb8b8453982473467b28e36bfac.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1134 height=822 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/d79f31cc23c9533be2d634ad02928a9d.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock and buy new accessories to dress up your own slime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/09850200d532d849d2a776a589a24676.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1282 height=888 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/dbce65dfda3c882cc84670f627d7e115.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=151 /></span>Prepare your slime team for an ever-evolving island survival adventure, where every journey is unique. Face procedurally generated challenges, enemies, and rewards as you explore island after island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/dbd4696440a9546f8f471c860ec4ca3b.avif?t=1788162591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras_big/dbd4696440a9546f8f471c860ec4ca3b.webp?t=1788162591 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/63bd3885920f79a0f19b0bc670e8008f.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/0500c062a934924a00edae2f3d2da5f1.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1040 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/b494016f58e2e3630ec5dfa3cb6bb9c2.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/f6120df163885273efceaa1eb9bb694a.avif?t=1788162591\" width=800 height=586 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/bbaa67942f32bf2d65b1e67c6c5afa72.avif?t=1788162591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras_big/bbaa67942f32bf2d65b1e67c6c5afa72.webp?t=1788162591 width=1560 height=987 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/cbabd6b521fab7967f776463c90a2c95.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Grow, nurture, and unleash a team of lovable slimes with endless possibilities! In this enchanting survival journey, breed quirky slime combinations, face wild island challenges, and embrace the thrill of adventure with your gooey companions. Can you raise the perfect slime squad to brave the unpredictable elements and explore as far as the islands go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/8537bdfa952e0a6dd9aa8c9f1cd362b2.avif?t=1788162591\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras_big/8537bdfa952e0a6dd9aa8c9f1cd362b2.webp?t=1788162591 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/a5f089329e9130dbb713dbf9cea70207.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Monthly Updates + Nightly Beta Builds!</strong> <br>Weekly updates with new accessories and items to  increase the size of your collection and more! (Join the nightly beta option for semi-daily updates for new contents that will later be included in the weekly public builds!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/2872e8d0e1df2cae260383fcc08e931e.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover endless possibilities as you breed different slimes, combining traits from both parents to create new, one-of-a-kind slime companions with unique abilities and appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/3588ed62e5d4552d46cbe4199560d186.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1316 height=1068 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/7f1dc0568eb7146809560ec8444dc5ee.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1200 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strengthen your slimes by feeding them, raising their stats, and unlocking new abilities. Proper care is essential for building a powerful team that can endure the challenges of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332460/extras/5d701fb8b8453982473467b28e36bfac.avif?t=1788162591\" width=1134 height=822 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=